  THIS BRICK ADDS (deliverables 1–3 of LA1′):

  1. THE FINITE-STAGE COMMUTATION THEOREM (`stage_commutant_eq_rightMul`,
     `stage_commutant_iff_eq_mulRight`): on a single stage's carrier — the full matrix
