       ‖T(germ a) − R_{b_C}(germ a)‖ ≤ ‖π_C(a)‖ · ‖TΩ − P_C(TΩ)‖   (`commutant_orbit_approx`)
     with ‖TΩ − P_C(TΩ)‖ → 0 along the stage filter (`commutant_orbit_tendsto`):
